        "answer": {
          "short": "$S_4=-2,\\quad S_5=3,\\quad S_6=-3$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}S_4&=1-2+3-4=-2\\\\S_5&=1-2+3-4+5=3\\\\S_6&=1-2+3-4+5-6=-3\\end{align*}$$",
